创新技术融入更真实的生活场景。</p><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero-actions\"><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"#about\" class=\"hero-btn\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">了解 CUCA</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">↗</span></a><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"#team\" class=\"hero-link\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">认识我们的团队</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">↘</span></a></div></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"orb a\" data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></div><div class=\"orb b\" data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></div><div class=\"orb c\" data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></div><div class=\"orb\" data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></div><div class=\"main-orb\" data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">CUCA</strong><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">HUMAN + AI</span></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero-tag tag-one\"><i data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></i><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">AI ROBOTICS / 智能机器人</span></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero-tag tag-two\"><i data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></i><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">HEALTH TECH / 健康科技</span></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero-tag tag-three\"><i data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></i><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">WELLNESS / 智能服务</span></div></div></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container hero-bottom\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">EST. 2024 · SINGAPORE</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><b data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">科技驱动 · 健康同行</b>&nbsp;&nbsp; ↗</span></div></section><section data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"about\" id=\"about\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container about-grid\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"about-header\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\">01 / COMPANY PROFILE</div><h2 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"section-heading\">关于 CUCA<br>让健康科技更贴近生活。</h2><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"accent-line\"></div><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"intro\">我们相信，未来的健康服务，应当更智能、更便捷，也更有人情味。</p></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"about-copy\"><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">CUCA HEALTH &amp; WELLNESS PTE. LTD. 于 2024 年在新加坡成立，专注人工智能与健康服务场景的融合，探索智能机器人、健康管理产品及新型健康服务的应用。</p><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">以「AI + 大健康 + 智能机器人 + 商业平台」为发展方向，CUCA 致力于连接技术、产品、门店与服务团队，为消费者和商业合作伙伴提供更完善的智能健康服务体验。</p><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">我们重视持续创新、专业运营与负责任的合作，在区域市场逐步建设可落地、可服务、可持续发展的业务体系。</p><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"about-stats\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"stat\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">2024</strong><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">成立于新加坡</small></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"stat\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">03</strong><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">核心业务方向</small></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"stat\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">AI +</strong><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">健康科技融合</small></div></div></div></div></section><section data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business\" id=\"business\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"section-top\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\">OUR BUSINESS / THREE PILLARS</div><h2 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"section-heading\">业务布局</h2></div><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">以技术为基础，以服务为核心，连接产品研发应用、商业落地与区域合作。</p></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-grid\"><article data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-card\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-no\">01 / ROBOTICS</span><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-icon\"><svg data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" x=\"4\" y=\"7\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" rx=\"3\"></rect><path data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" d=\"M12 3v4M9 3h6M4 13H2m20 0h-2M8 16h8\"></path><circle data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" cx=\"9\" cy=\"12\" r=\".8\"></circle><circle data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" cx=\"15\" cy=\"12\" r=\".8\"></circle></svg></div><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">AI 智能机器人</h3><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">面向门店与健康服务场景，提供智能按摩、艾灸及健康检测等机器人应用方案。</p></article><article data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-card\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-no\">02 / HEALTH TECHNOLOGY</span><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-icon\"><svg data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" d=\"M20.5 8.5c0 5.2-8.5 11-8.5 11S3.5 13.7 3.5 8.5a4.7 4.7 0 0 1 8.5-2.7 4.7 4.7 0 0 1 8.5 2.7Z\"></path><path data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" d=\"M5.5 12h4l2-3 2.1 6 1.8-3h3\"></path></svg></div><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">健康科技与产品</h3><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">整合健康管理产品、数字化工具及服务内容，提升用户的日常健康管理体验。</p></article><article data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-card\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-no\">03 / WELLNESS CENTERS</span><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-icon\"><svg data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" d=\"M4 21V5l8-3 8 3v16M2 21h20M8 8h2m4 0h2M8 12h2m4 0h2M10 21v-5h4v5\"></path></svg></div><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">智能理疗中心</h3><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">探索智能设备与线下门店服务协同，支持门店运营、培训及区域合作网络建设。</p></article></div></div></section><section data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"team\" id=\"team\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"team-header\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\">02 / LEADERSHIP &amp; TEAM</div><h2 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"section-heading\">我们的团队</h2></div><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"intro\">融合战略规划、市场拓展、运营交付与健康科技应用经验，共同推进 CUCA 的长期发展。</p></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"team-tabs\" aria-label=\"团队类别\"><button data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" type=\"button\" class=\"team-tab\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部成员</button><button data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" type=\"button\" class=\"team-tab\" aria-pressed=\"false\">管理团队</button></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"team-status\">正在加载团队…</div></div></section><section data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"philosophy\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container philosophy-grid\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\">CULTURE &amp; VALUES</div><h2 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">让技术创造价值，<br>让团队成就信任。</h2><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">持续探索科技与健康服务的交汇点，以专业、透明、协作与创新推动企业稳健发展。</p></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"values\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"value\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">01 / TRUST</strong><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">诚信与责任</h3><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">以真实信息、规范流程建立长期信任。</small></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"value\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">02 / INNOVATION</strong><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">创新与实践</h3><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">关注技术应用和真实服务场景。</small></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"value\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">03 / COLLABORATION</strong><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">开放与协作</h3><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">联合伙伴，共同构建服务生态。</small></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"value\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">04 / LONG-TERM</strong><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">长期与成长</h3><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">聚焦能力建设与可持续经营。</small></div></div></div></section><section data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"contact\" id=\"contact\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container contact-inner\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\">LET'S CONNECT</div><h2 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">合作，从一次对话开始。</h2><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">欢迎交流 AI 机器人应用、健康科技及智能理疗中心合作机会。</p></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"contact-actions\"><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"mailto:cuca13699@gmail.com?subject=CUCA%20Collaboration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">发送合作邮件</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">↗</span></a><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"/zh\" class=\"ghost\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">返回网站首页</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">↗</span></a></div></div></section></main><footer data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"footer\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"footer-main\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"/zh\" class=\"brand\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"brand-symbol\">C</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"brand-word\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">CUCA</strong><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">AI ROBOT · 2028</small></span></a><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"footer-about\">CUCA HEALTH &amp; WELLNESS PTE. LTD.<br>新加坡健康科技企业 · AI 智能机器人与健康服务应用平台。</p></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"